                <note rend="inline" type="source">500. A 4e/106: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chairman of the American Delegation, China Tariff
                        Revision Commission</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Arnold</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Shanghai</hi></placeName> [<date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content" calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-09-18"><hi rendition="#italic"
                        >undated</hi></date>].<lb/>[Received September 28, 1922—8:57
                        a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>Tariff Commission completed work and adjourned 28th.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Arnold</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
